    // 1.4.3 (QA V142-2): a FINISHED match is final. Its update is decided here and nowhere else (updateAllowed
    // picks this branch on the stored status, so the finishing write of a live match doesn't pay for it):
    //  - the scorer re-credits one of the last 3 rallies (same number of events; eventsStepOk → recreditOk:
    //    type, side and time unchanged, the player on the side that won the rally) and nothing else changes –
    //    no summary, rules, status, roster, title, times… (1.4.2 still let a summary-only write flip the winner
